VALUES ('Lubimbi Coalfield — Hwange Colliery / Zhong Jian JV (Lubimbi coalfield)', 'Hwange Lubimbi Energy Company (subsidiary of HCCL Holdings) — in development with Chinese partner Zhong Jiani Investment', 'Special Grant SG4764 (Lubimbi West) and Special Grant SG4364 (Lubimbi East — coal and coalbed methane exploration)', NULL, NULL, 'Zimbabwe', 'Matabeleland North Province', 'Lubimbi area, Matabeleland North, Zimbabwe (~245km north of Bulawayo; ~120km southeast of Hwange town)', -17.75, 27.20, 'None — landlocked', 'No railway', NULL, NULL, 'HCCL Holdings', '[{"year": 2022, "event": "HCCL began planning Lubimbi power plant development"}, {"year": 2023, "event": "Zimbabwe government approved HCCL reconstruction plan including Lubimbi power plant"}, {"year": 2024, "event": "HCCL Holdings restructured; Hwange Lubimbi Energy Company established as dedicated subsidiary; 50 MW power plant proposed; Chinese partner Zhong Jiani Investment engaged"}, {"year": 2025, "event": "Hwange Lubimbi Energy Company continuing development; Phase 1 (underground mine + wash plant) and Phase 2 (coke oven battery) being developed with Zhong Jiani"}]'::jsonb, '[{"year": null, "event": "Lubimbi coalfield: 245km north of Bulawayo, ~120km southeast of Hwange town — separate from main Hwange/Wankie coalfield"}, {"year": null, "event": "SAMREC-compliant resource statement being developed"}, {"year": null, "event": "Proposed 3-phase development: Phase 1 = underground mine + wash plant; Phase 2 = coke oven battery; Phase 3 = 50 MW power plant"}, {"year": null, "event": "SG4364 (Lubimbi East) includes coalbed methane (CBM) exploration rights"}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'Bituminous — coking and thermal', 'Karoo Supergroup Wankie Formation; potential for open cast and underground', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Underground (planned); open cast where overburden <35m', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '["Road (planned); no railway"]'::jsonb, NULL, false, '[]'::jsonb)
